Observer packaging defect, not candidate/helper failure:
package_completed_result.py successfully wrote both outside-target result JSON files,
then its final console print failed under Windows cp1252:
UnicodeEncodeError: 'charmap' codec can't encode character '\u2615' in position 488: character maps to <undefined>
Actual process exit status was 1. Both files retained; no target paths changed.
The immutable script remains unchanged. emit_result_utf8.py emits their existing UTF-8 bytes through sys.stdout.buffer.
